                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL EN UTILISANT UN MULTIPLEXAGE DU CANAL DE TRANSMISSION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DEVICE USING CHANNEL MULTIPLEXING IN WIRELESS COMMUNICATION</invention-title>
